  "content": "<p>喚醒你靈魂深處的力量。</p><p>在《<em>BLEACH 死神：魂之羈絆</em>》中，你將踏入一個光明與黑暗、傳統與變革交織的世界。選擇你的道路：化身為<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>死神</strong></span>，守護靈性平衡；或成為<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>滅卻師</strong></span>，以精準與知識清除威脅。</p><p>面對靈性生物，磨練自身能力，與獨特角色建立羈絆，做出影響旅程的抉擇。透過沉浸式<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>任務系統</strong></span>，每一步都將揭開你靈魂深處的奧秘——以及世界的命運。</p><p>你準備好超越人類的極限了嗎？</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1225885/description_9567185a-b3cd-477f-95d2-786eba3b1abc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"683\" height=\"373\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1225885/description_3fe0b39f-23bc-41c9-a120-89db26950545.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"686\" height=\"373\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1225885/description_b16b1108-6529-4ea6-96e6-0ab4b53c2376.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"692\" height=\"374\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>模組列表</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorers-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">探險家羅盤（作者：Chaosyr）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/what-are-they-up-to\" rel=\"nofollow\">他們在搞什麼（Watut）（作者：Corosus）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brandons-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brandon 核心（作者：brandon3055）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">應用能源2（作者：thetechnici4n）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API（Fabric/Forge/NeoForge）（作者：shedaniel）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-beams\" rel=\"nofollow\">戰利品光束：重裝版！（作者：shiroroku）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">裝飾方塊（作者：stohun）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender（Forge）（作者：TheAdubbz）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-titles\" rel=\"nofollow\">旅者標題（Forge/NeoForge）（作者：YUNGNICKYOUNG）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">鑿子與碎片 - Forge版（作者：AlgorithmX2）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡單語音聊天（作者：henkelmax）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ash-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ash API（作者：Trikzon）</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" rel=\"nofollow\">月光庫（作者：MehVahdJukaar）